cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the accompanying paper and identify the exact source archive hash or Git commit used."
type: software
title: "Private-capacity superactivation in Lean 4"
authors:
  - name: "QuAIR Team"
  - family-names: Zhu
    given-names: Chengkai
repository-code: "https://github.com/QudeLeap/lean-private-capacity"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 proofs of private-capacity superactivation for the transition channel
  and every erasure probability 1/2 <= p < 1, using the regularized information
  formula and the explicit quadratic lower bound, together
  with exact mathematical certificates and an explicit coverage map.
  This artifact does not formalize the complete paper or operational coding theorem.
